OL,3,GNEWSA'Frightening' spiking claims
OL,4,Ainvestigated by uni
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into claims members of a
OL,8,Frugby club planned to spike female
OL,9,Fstudents during freshers' week.
OL,11,FThe University of Bath said it has
OL,12,Fincreased security in nightclubs in
OL,13,Fresponse to "frightening" rumours
OL,14,Fcirculating on social media which
OL,15,Fassociate the university rugby club
OL,16,Fwith "disturbing and unacceptable
OL,17,Fbehaviour towards female students."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
