OL,3,GNEWSA'Frightening' spiking claims
OL,4,Ainvestigated by uni
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a joint statement, the University of
OL,7,FBath Rugby Club and students' union
OL,8,F(SU) said: "We have not organised,
OL,9,Fpromoted, or attempted to arrange any
OL,10,Factivity of this nature."
OL,12,FA spokesperson from the university said
OL,13,Fit is beginning a wider review of the
OL,14,Fculture around its sports clubs.
